<h2 class="bde-heading-506-115 bde-heading">
What Is Brandon Williams’s Salary With the Warriors?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-116 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-139 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-151 bde-f-text">
<p>Williams earns <strong>$2.63m</strong> in 2026-27, up from <strong>$2.27m</strong> last season. He’s fourteenth on the <a href="/teams/golden-state-warriors/">Golden State</a> payroll, level with <a href="/players/dalen-terry/">Dalen Terry</a> on the same figure and the same structure.</p>
<p>None of it is guaranteed. His career earnings come to about <strong>$4.90m</strong> across five seasons, and three of those produced no published salary. The figure is <strong>1.19%</strong> of Golden State’s <strong>$220.84m</strong> payroll.</p>

</div><div class="bde-shortcode-506-152 bde-shortcode"><div class="nba-fin" data-nba-fin="salary_sources">
