<h3>What’s Next for Brandon Williams Beyond 2026?</h3><p>Williams has no guaranteed money, so the immediate question is whether he's on the roster past the January deadline when salaries become fully protected. Clearing that date would take him to free agency in the summer of 2027 at 27 with a full season behind him.</p><script src="/_ported/8334868131c3.js" is:inline></script>
