<h2>How Much Does Brandon Williams Earn Over Time?</h2><p>A <strong>$2.63m</strong> season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time.</p><div class="nf-time"><div class="nf-stat"><div class="nf-label">Per Month</div><div class="nf-value">$218,802</div></div><div class="nf-stat"><div class="nf-label">Per Week</div><div class="nf-value">$50,493</div></div><div class="nf-stat"><div class="nf-label">Per Day</div><div class="nf-value">$7,193</div></div><div class="nf-stat"><div class="nf-label">Per Hour</div><div class="nf-value">$300</div></div><div class="nf-stat"><div class="nf-label">Per Minute</div><div class="nf-value">$5</div></div></div><script src="/_ported/8334868131c3.js" is:inline></script>
