<h2 class="bde-heading-506-126 bde-heading">
What Is Brandon Williams’s Net Worth in 2026?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-127 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-143 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-shortcode-506-157 bde-shortcode"><div class="nba-fin" data-nba-fin="worth">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/_ported/08ba6176394a.css">
<div class="nf-stat"><div class="nf-label">Estimated Net Worth</div><div class="nf-value">$2M</div><div class="nf-rank">Estimated from career earnings</div></div><script src="/_ported/8334868131c3.js" is:inline></script>
</div>
</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Williams’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$2m</strong>, worked back from about <strong>$4.90m</strong> in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him.</p>
<p>The real total is higher than that, because three of his five seasons were spent on two-way contracts and that compensation isn’t published. What can be said is that he’d earned under <strong>$2.32m</strong> in any single season before last year, and he went undrafted, so there was no rookie contract to start him off.</p>

</div>
